        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our market strategy for Unum US is to effectively deliver an integrated offering of employee benefit products in the group core market, which we define for Unum US as employee groups with fewer than 2,000 employees, the group large case market, and the supplemental and voluntary market.",
